Z||000024||ChopTop||12-20-2001||10:01 AM||||Perfume/cologne, easily one of the worst gifts out there, the only person who likes how it smells is the person who purchased it.<P>Recycled Christmas gifts, no explanation necessary.<P>Any toy or game that makes obnoxious sounds, while the kid may play with it for two minutes, chances are it will be left on floor driving everyone else crazy.  However they are the perfect gift to give to a kid if you don’t like their parents.<P>1001 piece puzzles, why not just tell the person, I know you don’t have a life.<P>Anything that says “As seen on TV”.  <P>||||reg||1
