Z||000039||My7Fieros||12-24-2001||05:06 PM||||<BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by AusFiero:<BR><B> My wife thinks they are definate no nos too. Why?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>More things not to get for christmas. <P>1. A voucher from a new girlfriend or boyfriend for a  free visit to an STD clinic.<BR>2. A Mustang   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> (Maybe we should put that up top)<BR>3. A casket and/or burial plot.<BR>4. Tickets to a Britney Spears concert. (ok Roger might like it)   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>5. A lifetime membership card to AA.<BR>6. A visit from the authorities. (that would have to suck, getting locked up Christmas day.)<BR>7. A Mustang. (well I know I said that but 2 would be worse than 1)hehe<BR>8. An iron duke to replace your V6.<BR>9. A 2.8 to replace your newly installed 3.8 or V8.<BR>10. A pine tree air freshener for your Fiero.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>#1- agreed<BR>#2- Not likely. Buy your g/f a new Mustang and Im pretty sure she'll dig it.....I mean, c'mon guys......<BR>#3-Yikes!<BR>#4- Been there, done that numerous times... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>#5- She'll prob need one after hearing about Fieros day in and day out!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>#6-I am the authorities..so she gets a "visit" every day lol.<BR>#7-refer to #2<BR>#8-lol..maybe if the v6 was completely dead and the duke was brand new...notice I said maybe. <BR>#9-cool for a spare<BR>#10- if saying that brings that thread back Im gonna travel down under and kick your a$$! (j/k)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/My7logo_1.gif"> ||||reg||1
